WEBVTT

01:20.010 --> 01:23.810
JUJUTSU KAISEN

01:30.260 --> 01:32.000
Maki?

01:31.480 --> 01:38.490
Episode 17: Kyoto Sister School Exchange Event - Group Battle 3 -

01:32.000 --> 01:34.570
She's just a weakling.

01:34.570 --> 01:36.360
She can't even see curses.

01:36.360 --> 01:38.910
She's just a normal person
swinging around cursed tools.

01:39.260 --> 01:41.040
She's forever a fourth-grade.

01:41.440 --> 01:44.710
Why is she even a jujutsu sorcerer at all?

01:45.140 --> 01:46.980
Break's over.

01:46.980 --> 01:48.590
Okay.

01:48.590 --> 01:49.710
I see.

01:50.740 --> 01:52.180
That's a relief.

01:53.150 --> 01:54.260
Stupid Mai!

01:54.640 --> 01:57.800
This woman is incredibly strong!

01:58.580 --> 02:01.420
She's using a longer weapon,
so I'd like to close the distance,

02:01.420 --> 02:03.460
but it's all I can do
to dodge and parry her!

02:03.460 --> 02:05.360
If she were using the blade,

02:06.250 --> 02:08.690
I would've died twice!

02:08.690 --> 02:10.410
She's only fourth-grade?!

02:11.210 --> 02:14.460
She could easily defeat
second-grade cursed spirits!

02:16.120 --> 02:21.210
And how is she able to swing such a long sword
in this forest with so much stuff in the way?!

02:41.680 --> 02:46.170
New Shadow Style: Simple Domain!

02:47.720 --> 02:51.390
This allows me to attack anything that
enters the 2.21-meter radius of my domain

02:51.390 --> 02:53.340
on full-auto reflex.

02:53.880 --> 02:57.660
It's released if my feet move from
the point they're at when it's activated.

02:58.380 --> 02:59.400
On top of that,

02:59.400 --> 03:02.020
my Quick Draw is specialized
against enemies attacking head-on.

03:02.020 --> 03:05.430
It's the fastest technique of the
New Shadow School, wrapping my blade

03:05.830 --> 03:08.300
in cursed energy while it's in
the sheath to accelerate it.

03:08.300 --> 03:10.560
But don't think this will settle the match.

03:10.560 --> 03:12.960
Focus my full strength
on creating an opening first.

03:12.960 --> 03:14.420
Iaijutsu, huh?

03:14.420 --> 03:16.680
Looks like she has some trick, too.

03:17.000 --> 03:18.870
But there's a difference in our reach.

03:18.870 --> 03:22.130
Rather than hit me, she likely wants to knock
away my cursed tool and create an opening.

03:23.800 --> 03:25.760
In which case...

03:26.350 --> 03:27.300
She broke it?!

03:27.300 --> 03:29.440
She's throwing away her
reach advantage now?!

03:31.240 --> 03:31.900
She threw it?!

03:33.770 --> 03:34.480
A hidden weapon?!

03:34.480 --> 03:35.360
Her intuition's sharp!

03:35.360 --> 03:37.370
She's trying to close the gap with a decoy!

03:41.510 --> 03:42.790
My legs moved!

03:43.150 --> 03:46.830
But that's fine. I'll pull back and
draw her in just close enough, then—

03:50.140 --> 03:52.440
Aikidou?! What a clever woman!

03:53.940 --> 03:54.840
Huh?

03:55.660 --> 03:57.920
Nice sword you've got here.

03:58.560 --> 04:00.250
Sword-stealing?

04:00.650 --> 04:01.930
Give it back?

04:07.500 --> 04:09.520
What an interesting girl.

04:09.520 --> 04:12.970
You should promote her
to second-grade already.

04:12.970 --> 04:15.400
I feel the same way,

04:15.400 --> 04:17.820
but the Zenin clan keeps getting in the way.

04:17.820 --> 04:21.020
They should just change their
position and accept her already.

04:22.550 --> 04:26.100
I just can't understand such
restraints, aside from money.

04:26.100 --> 04:28.200
I see you're just as miserly as ever.

04:28.200 --> 04:32.540
More importantly, the footage showing
the area around Yuuji keeps cutting out a lot.

04:32.540 --> 04:34.860
Animals are fickle.

04:34.860 --> 04:37.290
Sharing my senses with them is tiring, too.

04:37.290 --> 04:39.590
Huh? Is that true?

04:39.590 --> 04:42.170
Let's be blunt. Which side
are you on, Mei-san?

04:42.170 --> 04:43.480
Which side?

04:43.480 --> 04:45.630
I'm on money's side.

04:45.630 --> 04:48.440
There's no value to anything
that can't be traded for money.

04:48.440 --> 04:51.530
You can't make money out of it, after all.

04:51.880 --> 04:54.010
Just how much have you saved up?

04:55.050 --> 04:58.190
I don't know what he's planning,

04:58.190 --> 05:02.280
but it won't be that easy to
deal with Yuuji anymore.

05:03.120 --> 05:06.570
Oh, they're moving.

05:07.990 --> 05:12.030
All the cursed spirits released
into the area have charms on them,

05:12.030 --> 05:14.300
and when the cursed spirit disappears,

05:13.370 --> 05:14.290
Curse

05:15.380 --> 05:19.380
the corresponding charm here, in the viewing
area, is extinguished simultaneously.

05:20.160 --> 05:22.720
Each charm is extinguished
differently according to

05:22.720 --> 05:25.130
the cursed energy registered beforehand.

05:25.130 --> 05:28.720
Tokyo

05:25.580 --> 05:28.730
When the Tokyo school
exorcises one, they burn red.

05:28.720 --> 05:32.430
Kyoto

05:28.730 --> 05:32.430
When the Kyoto school
exorcises one, they burn blue.

05:32.840 --> 05:38.400
Since Maki-san is in the match, any extinguished
by unregistered responses burn red, as well.

05:35.930 --> 05:38.400
Tokyo

05:38.920 --> 05:40.870
One to one, huh?

05:40.870 --> 05:43.590
No one's paying enough attention to the game.

05:43.590 --> 05:46.520
Why can't they just get along?

05:46.520 --> 05:48.400
They must take after you, Utahime.

05:48.400 --> 05:49.990
You're the only one I have an issue with!

05:49.990 --> 05:52.840
By the way, Panda-kun's
the one who exorcised it.

05:53.040 --> 05:54.750
Lucky!

05:54.990 --> 05:57.580
Get down here, you damn witch!

05:58.080 --> 06:01.000
I've come down a few times already.

06:01.000 --> 06:04.970
Hurry up and try to catch me, first-year!

06:07.200 --> 06:09.540
Her cursed energy wind
is strong enough to lift me!

06:09.540 --> 06:11.920
It hurts like hell when pebbles
and branches get caught in it, too!

06:11.920 --> 06:14.340
If I drop my guard, it'll gouge my flesh!

06:22.560 --> 06:25.030
How dare you hurt my precious face?

06:25.300 --> 06:28.270
A scar on the face is a
badge of honor for a man.

06:29.320 --> 06:32.160
Though it's only a flaw on a woman.

06:32.160 --> 06:33.400
Huh?

06:33.790 --> 06:36.990
You think being a jujutsu sorcerer
is all about strength, don't you?

06:36.990 --> 06:38.750
And it actually is.

06:38.750 --> 06:41.200
That's only for men.

06:41.200 --> 06:42.040
Huh?

06:42.040 --> 06:47.140
Even if they are strong, women have to
be cute, or they'll be undervalued.

06:47.140 --> 06:51.640
Of course, even if they're cute, they'll still
be undervalued if they're not also strong.

06:52.080 --> 06:53.390
Do you get it?

06:53.760 --> 06:57.890
They don't demand strength
from female jujutsu sorcerers.

06:57.890 --> 06:59.440
They demand perfection!

07:00.430 --> 07:01.840
And on top of that,

07:01.840 --> 07:05.270
Mai-chan is also fighting against
even more outrageous demands.

07:06.070 --> 07:10.460
I get that you're a pain in the ass!

07:16.820 --> 07:20.880
She's only a first-year, and she's
already used to fighting?

07:21.710 --> 07:24.800
She's still going strong,
no matter how often I blast her.

07:25.470 --> 07:30.590
I'm used to getting knocked around.

07:31.150 --> 07:34.210
If I up my output any further,
I might kill her.

07:34.600 --> 07:37.130
No, that's just an excuse.

07:37.130 --> 07:39.610
The main reason I can't attack her

07:39.610 --> 07:41.000
is Inumaki-kun.

07:42.330 --> 07:44.160
Cursed speech uses the power of words.

07:44.160 --> 07:46.240
It imbues cursed energy into sound,

07:46.240 --> 07:50.110
so you just have to protect your brain
and your ears with cursed energy.

07:50.480 --> 07:54.110
Cursed speech is a technique specialized
for use against cursed spirits.

07:54.110 --> 07:59.750
Like I said before, it's nothing for a sorcerer
to be afraid of if you know it's coming.

08:00.150 --> 08:05.250
Conversely, if you don't know whether or not
it's coming, you're constantly distracted.

08:05.970 --> 08:09.680
I'm not used to protecting the inside
of my head in the first place...

08:10.060 --> 08:12.970
He's such a nuisance whether he's here or not!

08:13.780 --> 08:16.560
All done with your lecture?!

08:16.560 --> 08:22.010
Perfection is easy compared
to what's demanded of Mai-chan!

08:22.550 --> 08:27.840
She's from the Zenin clan, one of the three major clans of elite jujutsu sorcerers.

08:27.840 --> 08:30.700
Perfection is expected
as a matter of course there.

08:30.700 --> 08:34.330
"Inherit the Zenin clan's
hereditary technique."

08:34.330 --> 08:38.650
Any who don't meet that demand start their sorcerer lives as failures.

08:38.920 --> 08:43.920
Among those, women aren't even
allowed to stand at the starting line.

08:44.410 --> 08:47.820
Without the Zenin clan lineage,
they're not considered jujutsu sorcerers.

08:47.820 --> 08:51.140
And if they're not jujutsu sorcerers,
they're not considered people.

08:51.140 --> 08:56.510
She's lived her entire life with such scorn
in a family without a shred of affection.

08:57.560 --> 09:02.140
Can you imagine how much
Mai-chan and others suffered

09:02.140 --> 09:05.270
just to obtain what we
enjoy as a matter of course?

09:07.220 --> 09:10.820
Why don't you try thinking that
over with that brain of yours

09:11.700 --> 09:13.480
that confuses curses for friends?

09:15.710 --> 09:17.430
Shut up.

09:17.430 --> 09:20.520
You think misfortune is
a free pass to do anything?

09:21.280 --> 09:22.860
What, then?

09:22.860 --> 09:26.460
You're satisfied with those who are blessed
getting trash-talked behind their backs?

09:26.790 --> 09:29.080
That's how Saori-chan...

09:30.720 --> 09:34.640
I can't stand her,
regardless of her upbringing,

09:35.230 --> 09:39.340
and I love Maki-san, who
endured the same upbringing.

09:39.860 --> 09:44.560
Have you all even bothered to
think about what kind of person

09:44.870 --> 09:47.430
the idiot you're trying to curse is?

09:48.100 --> 09:51.530
What makes us obligated to meet such
perfection or such absurd demands?

09:52.650 --> 09:55.820
Is your entire life just a job?!

09:55.820 --> 09:59.080
Straw Doll Technique: Hairpin!

10:04.530 --> 10:08.420
This is why she kept shooting those
nails that didn't land any hits?!

10:09.930 --> 10:11.050
Tsk!

10:25.190 --> 10:28.520
You might have brought me down,
but you still won't reach me!

10:30.980 --> 10:33.360
No, I reached you.

10:33.950 --> 10:36.150
This is plenty!

10:36.150 --> 10:37.900
My broom's bristle?

10:37.900 --> 10:39.400
She grazed it just now?

10:40.000 --> 10:43.370
I don't give a damn about
"men" this and "women" that!

10:43.450 --> 10:46.380
You can keep that shit to yourselves!

10:46.380 --> 10:49.840
I love myself when I'm pretty
and all dressed up!

10:49.840 --> 10:52.920
And I love myself when I'm being strong!

10:53.550 --> 10:54.640
I am...

10:56.060 --> 10:58.480
Kugisaki Nobara!

11:01.270 --> 11:03.350
I can't control my broom!

11:03.350 --> 11:06.470
If I hit her with my hammer,
I might kill her.

11:08.140 --> 11:09.150
So...

11:11.020 --> 11:12.110
A squeaky hammer?!

11:21.420 --> 11:23.200
One more time!

11:31.020 --> 11:33.590
Just barely within effective range.

11:34.150 --> 11:38.010
I'm so glad it hit.

11:40.220 --> 11:43.010
JUJUTSU KAISEN

11:45.680 --> 11:48.010
JUJUTSU KAISEN

11:48.950 --> 11:50.970
Hello? Momo?

11:51.950 --> 11:54.200
Don't worry, it was a rubber bullet.

11:54.200 --> 11:58.410
More importantly, that light
was Ultimate Cannon, right?

11:58.410 --> 12:01.280
But I can't get in touch with Mechamaru.

12:01.280 --> 12:04.250
If he was cornered enough to use such
a powerful technique, and now this,

12:04.250 --> 12:05.910
he most likely lost.

12:05.910 --> 12:08.320
Panda will likely be returning.

12:08.320 --> 12:10.950
You should leave that spot and
support everyone from the air.

12:11.680 --> 12:13.690
We're all in trouble without you.

12:14.200 --> 12:15.070
Yeah.

12:15.900 --> 12:18.510
Mai-chan, I...

12:19.110 --> 12:21.850
It's all right, Momo. I know.

12:22.500 --> 12:23.920
Yeah.

12:23.920 --> 12:28.020
What, not going to call your friends?

12:28.020 --> 12:31.810
I don't mind going two-on-one.

12:31.810 --> 12:35.740
There are many ways to enjoy this, right?

12:36.340 --> 12:38.530
I could have everyone beat you together,

12:38.530 --> 12:40.710
but I'd like to enjoy you...

12:41.650 --> 12:42.780
by myself.

12:43.040 --> 12:46.740
Call me "Onee-chan," little sister.

12:47.870 --> 12:50.630
What do you think of Maki-san?

12:50.630 --> 12:53.710
She'll be mad no matter how I answer!

12:54.150 --> 12:57.250
I-I think she's a wonderful woman.

12:57.250 --> 13:00.270
Huh? I'm talking about as a sorcerer.

13:00.270 --> 13:02.880
Oh, that? Good...

13:04.540 --> 13:08.600
Honestly, I still don't know
that much about jujutsu,

13:09.110 --> 13:11.400
but she's really strong in a fight.

13:11.400 --> 13:14.760
Maybe it's her balance? The way
she walks is scary on its own.

13:15.110 --> 13:17.160
Maki-san's a fourth-grade.

13:17.160 --> 13:19.060
Huh? Seriously?

13:19.540 --> 13:22.420
Her family's an annoying clan of sorcerers,

13:23.450 --> 13:25.670
so after she kind of
emancipated herself and left,

13:25.670 --> 13:28.000
they've been interfering with her promotion.

13:28.490 --> 13:32.960
I thought families of jujutsu sorcerers
welcomed powerful sorcerers.

13:32.960 --> 13:36.030
They won't acknowledge what
they've already rejected,

13:36.030 --> 13:37.500
because they're idiots.

13:37.850 --> 13:40.620
But if she performs well
at the exchange event

13:40.620 --> 13:43.440
and her name gets spread around,

13:43.440 --> 13:46.380
it'll be harder for them to harass her like that.

13:46.670 --> 13:50.010
So let's start by winning the group battle!

13:50.010 --> 13:52.970
Fight like you're going to die again!

13:52.970 --> 13:54.100
Sure.

13:54.100 --> 13:55.810
I can hear you.

13:57.200 --> 13:58.340
Jeez.

13:59.390 --> 14:03.070
I shouldn't let myself get distracted.

14:03.530 --> 14:06.380
What are you smiling about?!

14:14.600 --> 14:17.450
So what if she hides out of sight?

14:17.950 --> 14:21.040
Is she an idiot, trying
to gain distance from me?

14:22.140 --> 14:22.630
Tsk!

14:22.630 --> 14:24.000
From below?!

14:28.230 --> 14:29.260
I already knew.

14:29.980 --> 14:33.770
Maki has a talent I don't.

14:34.690 --> 14:37.970
Have you heard about Ougi's daughters?

14:37.970 --> 14:41.490
One can't even see curses,
let alone use techniques.

14:41.490 --> 14:43.770
Twins are a sign of ill fortune.

14:44.220 --> 14:46.870
This might actually be a good thing.

14:46.870 --> 14:49.930
I couldn't bear to see
an eldest son as a servant.

14:54.920 --> 14:55.880
Mai.

14:56.460 --> 14:59.370
What's the matter? Hurry up.

15:01.280 --> 15:02.670
No.

15:02.670 --> 15:04.190
What is it?

15:04.190 --> 15:06.770
We'll get in trouble if we're late again.

15:08.240 --> 15:09.380
They're there.

15:12.170 --> 15:13.400
Again?

15:15.890 --> 15:18.270
All right, fine.

15:18.270 --> 15:23.280
Are you ho... ho...

15:20.080 --> 15:20.770
Come on.

15:21.200 --> 15:22.780
Close your eyes.

15:22.780 --> 15:23.280
Huh?

15:28.520 --> 15:31.320
If you can't see them,
it's the same as if they're not there.

15:33.030 --> 15:36.280
You've always acted like you had no fear

15:37.060 --> 15:40.060
and plowed forward toward your future.

15:40.060 --> 15:42.530
I hated you.

15:44.290 --> 15:47.130
You're leaving the clan, Maki?

15:47.600 --> 15:49.920
You have plenty of servants, right?

15:49.920 --> 15:54.600
Don't worry, though. I'll come
back someday, Clan Leader.

15:56.610 --> 15:57.940
Why would you return?

15:58.640 --> 16:01.980
Because I'm going to be
the head of the Zenin clan!

16:05.250 --> 16:09.400
Then I'll put you through
ordeals befitting that!

16:11.050 --> 16:12.700
Do as you please.

16:13.490 --> 16:15.290
And Mai, as well.

16:18.380 --> 16:20.360
She has nothing to do with this.

16:29.700 --> 16:30.960
Liar.

16:33.960 --> 16:35.520
I hate you!

17:22.540 --> 17:24.070
You fired six shots!

17:24.070 --> 17:25.270
I won't let you reload!

17:25.270 --> 17:30.240
I hate you!

17:31.740 --> 17:32.730
Which is why

17:35.390 --> 17:38.670
I never told you about my first love

17:39.620 --> 17:43.100
or my technique!

17:44.590 --> 17:50.090
"Construction" uses one's cursed energy
to create matter from nothing.

17:50.550 --> 17:52.380
It differs from the manifestation

17:52.380 --> 17:56.000
of an innate domain within the
barrier of a domain expansion.

17:56.000 --> 18:02.080
The matter produced by Construction doesn't
disappear when the cursed technique ends.

18:02.950 --> 18:05.980
Because of that, it consumes
a lot of cursed energy

18:05.980 --> 18:07.970
and puts a heavy strain on the body.

18:08.720 --> 18:12.140
Creating one bullet a day is Mai's maximum.

18:13.740 --> 18:18.130
That's why she uses a revolver to create
an obvious bluff of her bullet count.

18:19.390 --> 18:22.160
I win.

18:28.400 --> 18:31.310
She caught the bullet?

18:32.110 --> 18:33.550
Ow...

18:34.800 --> 18:37.600
I shouldn't touch that with my bare hands.

18:42.290 --> 18:45.310
Maki has a talent I don't.

18:46.490 --> 18:48.210
She's similar to Mechamaru,

18:48.210 --> 18:50.510
with a Heavenly Pact that's
somewhat the opposite.

18:51.380 --> 18:54.440
Normally, she would have been
born with a cursed technique.

18:55.100 --> 18:56.600
But in exchange for that,

18:56.600 --> 18:59.880
she was granted superhuman
physical abilities.

19:00.920 --> 19:03.080
The Zenin clan wouldn't acknowledge it.

19:04.170 --> 19:08.780
That talent I lacked.

19:09.900 --> 19:13.050
I think we can call this settled?

19:15.470 --> 19:18.300
Why did you leave the clan?

19:18.300 --> 19:21.160
Huh? Do I have to spell it out?

19:21.160 --> 19:23.050
You joined Jujutsu Tech
yourself, didn't you?

19:23.050 --> 19:24.060
I...

19:24.630 --> 19:27.340
never wanted to be a jujutsu sorcerer!

19:28.510 --> 19:30.170
It's your fault!

19:30.170 --> 19:31.930
Because you tried so hard to be one,

19:31.930 --> 19:34.190
I was forced to put forth effort, too!

19:34.960 --> 19:39.110
I'm so sick of trying so hard,
facing pain and scary things!

19:39.840 --> 19:42.920
What was so bad about being
ordered around back home?!

19:42.920 --> 19:46.940
We could have just done a few
chores and lived a normal life!

19:49.920 --> 19:54.480
Why wouldn't you stay at
the bottom with me?

20:01.140 --> 20:06.280
Because I would have
hated myself if I did that.

20:06.820 --> 20:08.240
That's the only reason.

20:09.980 --> 20:11.170
Sorry.

20:15.240 --> 20:18.520
Onee-chan, don't let go!

20:18.520 --> 20:20.140
I won't let go.

20:20.140 --> 20:21.400
Never?

20:21.900 --> 20:23.730
Jeez, give it a rest.

20:23.730 --> 20:26.900
Never leave me behind.

20:26.900 --> 20:28.480
Of course I won't.

20:28.960 --> 20:30.540
We're sisters.

20:36.020 --> 20:37.630
You liar.

20:38.620 --> 20:40.640
I hate you.

20:40.510 --> 20:45.010
Kyoto Sister School Exchange Event Group Battle
Zenin Mai
Kugisaki Nobara

20:40.510 --> 20:45.010
— Retired

22:15.020 --> 22:17.520
Juju Stroll

22:24.710 --> 22:27.020
I'm hungry.

22:27.600 --> 22:32.790
If I recall, the edamame I had left over
from lunch was in the fridge...

22:45.400 --> 22:46.430
Sorry.

22:46.430 --> 22:49.920
Please look at least a little guilty!

22:49.930 --> 22:56.680
Seafood

22:50.480 --> 22:52.810
Here, have this and forgive me.

22:52.810 --> 22:56.680
No, I'm not interested
in late-night cup ramen.

22:58.310 --> 23:00.690
Hot
Chili
Pepper

22:58.310 --> 23:00.690
Milk

22:59.460 --> 23:00.690
How about this?!

23:00.690 --> 23:03.690
Nishimiya-style

23:00.690 --> 23:03.690
Seafood Cup Ramen

23:00.690 --> 23:03.690
Arrangement!!

23:00.880 --> 23:03.690
Nishimiya-style Seafood Cup Ramen arrangement!

23:04.370 --> 23:07.150
One: use scissors to chop up hot chili peppers

23:07.150 --> 23:08.840
into the seafood cup ramen!

23:09.730 --> 23:13.230
Two: fill the container halfway with milk.

23:13.230 --> 23:16.410
Three: add hot water up to the line inside!

23:16.410 --> 23:19.640
Since we're using milk,
make sure the water's boiling hot!

